{"id":21167,"path":"/grammar-points/a2/the-different-uses-of-the-verb-get/","parentId":542,"order":290,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a2","depth":3,"title":"The different uses of the verb ‘get’","seo":{"title":"The different uses of the verb 'get' - Test-English","description":"Learn the different uses of the verb 'get' in this A2 Pre-intermediate grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/different-uses-of-the-verb-get.jpg"},"modified":"2026-02-25T08:42:18","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct option to complete each sentence.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"777\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct option to complete each sentence.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"776\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Fill in the gaps with <em>get</em>, <em>get to</em>, <em>got</em>, or <em>got to</em> .</h5> <div data-quiz=\"775\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h2>The different uses of the verb <strong>get</strong></h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/Different-uses-of-get_Grammar-chart.png\" alt=\"The different uses of the verb 'get'. \" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21210\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h4><strong>Get</strong> + noun: <strong>get an email, get a job, get a new TV, get the train, etc.</strong> (=receive, obtain, buy, bring, take)</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>We <span><strong>get lots of emails</strong></span> every day.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>My son <span><strong>got his driving license</strong></span> last week.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>Did you <span><strong>get a present</strong></span> for Tommy’s birthday?</em></li> <li><em>‘How did you go to Pam’s house?’ ‘I <span><strong>got a train</strong></span>.’&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h4><strong>Get</strong> + <a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/adjectives/\">adjective</a>: <strong>get married, get hungry, get old, get tired, etc.</strong> (=start to be married/hungry/old/etc.)</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Why did you <span><strong>get angry</strong></span>?</em></li> <li><em>It<span><strong>‘s getting dark</strong></span>.</em></li> <li><em>When did they <span><strong>get married</strong></span>?</em></li> <li><em>After breakfast, I have a shower and <span><strong>get dressed</strong></span>.</em></li> </ul> <h4><strong>Get to</strong> + place (=arrive)</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>What time did you <span><strong>get to the hospital</strong></span>?</em></li> <li><em>She <span><strong>gets to work</strong></span> at 8.</em></li> <li><em>It was difficult to <span><strong>get here</strong></span>.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>Do you usually <span><strong>get home</strong></span> late?</em></li> </ul> <p>❗ <strong>Note</strong> that we say <strong>get here</strong>, <strong>get there</strong> and <strong>get home</strong> (WITHOUT <strong>to</strong>).</p>","quizzes":[{"id":777,"questions":[{"id":6619,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Did you get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> I sent you yesterday?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a drink","lots of calls","the email","a check","this cool jacket","the train","a strange text message","milk","my diploma","anything"]}]},{"id":6620,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> from unknown numbers. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["the train","my diploma","milk","the email","this cool jacket","lots of calls","anything","a strange text message","a drink","a check"]}]},{"id":6621,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He gets <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> for $400 every month.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a drink","lots of calls","a check","the train","my diploma","this cool jacket","milk","the email","anything","a strange text message"]}]},{"id":6622,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'Where did you get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?' 'In a flea market.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["milk","lots of calls","a check","a drink","the train","this cool jacket","a strange text message","anything","my diploma","the email"]}]},{"id":6623,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Can you get me <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>, please?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a strange text message","a drink","the train","the email","milk","anything","lots of calls","a check","my diploma","this cool jacket"]}]},{"id":6624,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm going to the station to get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to Glasgow.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["milk","my diploma","the train","anything","a drink","a strange text message","this cool jacket","a check","the email","lots of calls"]}]},{"id":6625,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I gave her money to get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> for her baby. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["milk","anything","a strange text message","a drink","this cool jacket","the train","lots of calls","a check","my diploma","the email"]}]},{"id":6626,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'Can I get you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?' 'No, thanks. I'm fine.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a drink","my diploma","a strange text message","milk","lots of calls","this cool jacket","a check","the email","anything","the train"]}]},{"id":6627,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I studied very hard to get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a check","anything","my diploma","lots of calls","a drink","the email","the train","a strange text message","this cool jacket","milk"]}]},{"id":6628,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She got <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>, and she deleted it.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["lots of calls","anything","my diploma","the email","a check","the train","this cool jacket","a drink","a strange text message","milk"]}]}]},{"id":776,"questions":[{"id":6629,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If you get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>, take something from the fridge. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["thirsty","hungry","sick","late","mad","tired","lost","old","better","married"]}]},{"id":6630,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We got <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>, and there was no one we could ask for directions. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["thirsty","tired","late","sick","better","old","mad","hungry","married","lost"]}]},{"id":6631,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He got <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> and blocked me on Facebook.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["old","lost","late","mad","tired","better","sick","hungry","thirsty","married"]}]},{"id":6632,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Let's go back home. It's getting <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["late","hungry","mad","sick","tired","lost","old","better","married","thirsty"]}]},{"id":6633,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Let's rest for a minute. I'm getting <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["mad","thirsty","hungry","sick","late","married","better","old","tired","lost"]}]},{"id":6634,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I don't want to get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>. I like being single. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["hungry","tired","mad","thirsty","better","married","late","sick","old","lost"]}]},{"id":6635,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>You can have some water if you get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["tired","married","sick","better","old","thirsty","lost","mad","late","hungry"]}]},{"id":6636,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She's been very ill, but she's getting <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["tired","mad","better","married","old","late","sick","thirsty","hungry","lost"]}]},{"id":6637,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>People who don't have a healthy diet get <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> more easily.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["mad","hungry","better","lost","old","married","tired","sick","late","thirsty"]}]},{"id":6638,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He is getting <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> but in his mind, he is still young.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["married","old","tired","lost","better","sick","hungry","thirsty","late","mad"]}]}]},{"id":775,"questions":[{"id":6639,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> London at 5 in the evening.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6640,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>What time are you going to <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> home.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6641,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Call me when you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> there. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6642,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I have my first coffee of the day when I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> work. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6643,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We need to hurry up to <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the station in time. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6644,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>How have you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> here?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6645,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> school late, my teacher gets very mad.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6646,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the airport in record time but we missed our flight. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6647,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>When he <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> home, his parents were sleeping. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6648,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If you don't <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> here before 10, I will leave without you. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}